sequenceDiagram
    participant OL as Microsoft Outlook
    participant N8N as n8n Engine
    participant OAI as OpenAI API
    participant EXCEL as OneDrive Excel

    OL->>N8N: New email (poll trigger)
    rect rgb(225, 245, 254)
    N8N->>N8N: Dedup check (static data)
    N8N->>N8N: Strip HTML and thread history
    end
    N8N->>OAI: Stage 1 - Classify (gpt-4o-mini)
    OAI-->>N8N: JSON {intent, product_name, ...}
    N8N->>N8N: Parse JSON, route by intent
    alt Delivery_Tracking
        N8N->>EXCEL: Load Inventory sheet
        EXCEL-->>N8N: Inventory rows
        N8N->>EXCEL: Load Active_Deliveries sheet
        EXCEL-->>N8N: Delivery rows
    else Inventory intent
        N8N->>EXCEL: Load Inventory sheet
        EXCEL-->>N8N: Inventory rows
    end
    rect rgb(225, 245, 254)
    N8N->>N8N: Match product (exact/substring)
    N8N->>N8N: Compose data packet
    end
    N8N->>OAI: Stage 2 - Draft reply (gpt-4o-mini)
    OAI-->>N8N: Draft text
    rect rgb(225, 245, 254)
    N8N->>N8N: Scrub formatting
    N8N->>N8N: Compose subject
    end
    N8N->>OL: Create draft reply
    N8N->>N8N: Mark message processed
